            "value": "A vulnerability was found in Yonyou KSOA 9.0. The affected element is an unknown function of the file /kmf/edit_folder.jsp of the component HTTP GET Parameter Handler. Performing a manipulation of the argument folderid results in sql injection. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been made public and could be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way."
